{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11102170","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11102170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1110217001:1":{"text":"칼라의 친구 여러분! 군가 축제의 첫 관문인 첫 번째 시련의 신청 시간이 곧 마감될 예정입니다!","source_cn":"曼卡拉的老朋友们，战歌节初赛第一道试炼领取时间，即将截止！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49EFF701E0ADFE2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1110217002:1":{"text":"카운트다운 하겠습니다. 5! 4! 3! 2...","source_cn":"倒计时——五！四！三！二——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB9352A03A1CBD48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110217003:1":{"text":"잠시만요! 우르 부족도 시련에 참여하고 싶어요!","source_cn":"等一等！乌尔氏族想要领取试炼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8D5E250A78AFA89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1110217004:2":{"text":"네! 칼라처럼 이렇게 활기찬 털 뭉치는 처음 보네요! 우르 부족이라... 낯선 이름인데요!","source_cn":"哦！曼卡拉可是很少见到这么精神的毛团呢！乌尔氏族……这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F9E653AD7B670C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110217005:1":{"text":"그럼 지금부터 이 이름을 기억하도록.","source_cn":"你可以从现在开始记住这个名字。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A1D10EB303F32A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110217006:1":{"text":"하하! 우르 부족의 젊은 대표가 패기 넘치네요! 모두의 뜨거운 박수가 필요할 듯 하네요!","source_cn":"哈哈！乌尔氏族的年轻代表很有自信呢！曼卡拉觉得他值得大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF45722216BC941A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1110217007:1":{"text":"자신감이 넘치는 건 좋지만, “피의 시련”은 자신감만으로 통과할 수는 없답니다.","source_cn":"两位有信心自然是好，但“血之试炼”，可不是只靠信心就能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CAA244A23942507","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110217008:1":{"text":"“피의 시련?” 첫 번째 시련부터 어마무시해 보이네...","source_cn":"“血之试炼”？第一道试炼听起来就这么可怕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9842439850BC5E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110217009:1":{"text":"아이쿠, 무서워 보이나요? 괜찮아요. 불길한 험지에 가서 예측 불가한 야수들을 처치하고, 보물을 빼앗으면 됩니다. 그뿐이에요!","source_cn":"哎呀呀，听起来很可怕吗？没关系，只不过是需要前去不祥之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF604A888BF7843FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1110217009":{"text":"아이쿠, 무서워 보이나요? 괜찮아요. 불길한 험지에 가서 예측 불가한 야수들을 처치하고, 보물을 빼앗으면 됩니다. 그뿐이에요!","source_cn":"哎呀呀，听起来很可怕吗？没关系，只不过是需要前去不祥之险地，面对莫测之凶兽，掠取其视若珍宝之物，仅此而已！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF604A888BF7843FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1110217010:1":{"text":"듣기만 해도 몸을 동그랗게 말고 싶어!","source_cn":"光是用听的我已经想把自己团起来了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2D9436A2585617C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110217011:1":{"text":"으흠! 그럼 제 옆에 있는 우르 부족의 두 용사들...","source_cn":"嗯哼！那么请我身边这两位来自乌尔氏族的勇士——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A59D27799969FFF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110217012:1":{"text":"소렌.","source_cn":"索恩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x67DACE140CECB2A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110217013:1":{"text":"아, 아르사...","source_cn":"阿、阿尔萨……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x913543E9546E2C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1110217014:1":{"text":"소렌과 아르사! 우르 부족을 대표해 <style=\"highlight\">피의 시련</style>에 참가한 것을 환영합니다! 선혈로 군가 축제의 막을 열어보세요!","source_cn":"索恩和阿尔萨！欢迎你们代表乌尔氏族，迎接你们的<sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB3C07A6F159C5C3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110217015:1":{"text":"칼라의 이야기에 귀 기울여주세요! <style=\"highlight\">피의 시련</style>이란, 바로...","source_cn":"请好好听曼卡拉说！<style=highlight>血...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9891662138CC9615","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110217016:1":{"text":"초승달이 차오르는 밤에 붉은 모래 거미 지역에 있는 거미 소굴로 가서 그 안에 있는 거미알을 가져오는 겁니다!","source_cn":"在新月之夜，赶赴赤沙蛛域的蜘蛛巢穴，将里面的蜘蛛蛋交给我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18CA7FF9B47C78C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110217017:1":{"text":"붉은 모래 거미 지역이라니! 전에 아버지가 이야기해준 적이 있는데, 그곳은 거대한 거미들이 점거하고 있는 아주 위험한 지역이래. 모래까지 피로 빨갛게 물들었다고 했어...","source_cn":"赤沙蛛域！我听老爹讲过！那里是盘踞着巨大蜘蛛的凶险之地...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB94F7136412E2CCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110217018:2":{"text":"방심해선 안 돼. 초승달이 차오르는 밤이면... 이틀 후겠지?","source_cn":"不能掉以轻心。新月之夜……那应该是两天后，对吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5438DB687AC52A6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1110217019:1":{"text":"맞아요! 이틀 후 새벽에 제가 용사들을 직접 배웅할 겁니다!","source_cn":"没错！我会在两天后的清晨为勇者们送行的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D20F279D91FC106","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110217020:1":{"text":"그럼, 이틀 동안 만반의 준비를 하시길 바랍니다! ","source_cn":"利用这段时间做足准备吧！可别怪曼卡拉没提醒诸位！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16658FE7A7EDE639","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:0:1":{"text":"그뿐... 이라고?","source_cn":"仅此……而已？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFD2978470F50B1A8","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"그뿐... 이라고?","female":"그뿐... 이라고?","variant_male_record_index":"62866","variant_female_record_index":"62867","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:11:1:2":{"text":"스릴 넘치네?","source_cn":"这么刺激？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x04754CBECD84F5B5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"스릴 넘치네?","female":"스릴 넘치네?","variant_male_record_index":"62868","variant_female_record_index":"62869","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:曼卡拉":{"text":"칼라","source":"曼卡拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"아르사","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":24,"localized_text_count":23,"speaker_count":3}}